[38;5;252m[1m## Why I trust the passing suite[0m[0m
[0m[0m
A green differential suite is worthless if it cannot fail, so [38;5;10mmutation_check.sh[0m builds eight deliberately-wrong [38;5;10m.so[0ms and requires the suite to reject each. All eight are caught. That loop also found a flaw in my own tooling first: my [38;5;10mchoff[0m mutant initially patched a doc comment rather than the code and was reported as "not detected".[0m[0m
